   "heading": "Better instructions",
   "say": "The repair was a stricter brief. The critic must now quote the document sentence behind each issue, or drop it, and the rewrite may never delete a correct calculation. After that, no pairing added more hallucinations than it removed. But the gains are two or three answers in {104|a hundred and four}: that could be chance.",
